{"id":"fd0d531fb2f84c11","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-countable-choice-family.md","title":"ZFC Countable Choice Family","display":"df-zfc-countable-choice-family — ZFC Countable Choice Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-countable-choice-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-countable-choice-family"],"display":"df-zfc-countable-choice-family — ZFC Countable Choice Family","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-countable-choice-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-countable-choice-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-countable-choice-family — ZFC Countable Choice Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"332bc4fce3564b85\" href=\"?note=332bc4fce3564b85\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md\">../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A,f\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal A,f\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"332bc4fce3564b85\" href=\"?note=332bc4fce3564b85\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md\">../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CountableChoiceFamily}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CountableChoiceFamily}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的最小等势序数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality.md\">58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega\">\\(\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}countable\\text{-}choice\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{CountableChoiceFamily}_S(\\mathcal A) \\leftrightarrow |\\mathcal A|\\leq\\aleph_0\\land \\exists f\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S(f,\\mathcal A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}countable\\text{-}choice\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{CountableChoiceFamily}_S(\\mathcal A) \\leftrightarrow |\\mathcal A|\\leq\\aleph_0\\land \\exists f\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S(f,\\mathcal A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The upstream choice-function predicate already requires every member of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\">\\(\\mathcal A\\)</span> to be nonempty and types <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> on all of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\">\\(\\mathcal A\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"332bc4fce3564b85","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"332bc4fce3564b85","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的最小等势序数，使用 [[58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal A,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CountableChoiceFamily}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_0\\coloneqq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}countable\\text{-}choice\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{CountableChoiceFamily}_S(\\mathcal A) \\leftrightarrow |\\mathcal A|\\leq\\aleph_0\\land \\exists f\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S(f,\\mathcal A)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal A","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"te